WEBVTT

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.150
No use... I used more power than I thought.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.490
It's all I can do to keep standing.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.540
Ah... We have another lovely lady.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.790
And quite tempting, too.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.290
You would, at a time like this!

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.460
No! Not now!

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.690
Big Brother...

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.020
Gimme that!

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:51.440
I figured it was you.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:54.900
This is what happens when you don't listen to people's warnings.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.870
And what's with the shameless outfit?

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.330
Come on...

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.120
Say something!

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.260
W-Why, you...!

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:17.800
This way, please.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.350
Big Brother!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.520
If you've time to play,
you've time to retrieve the Lagu.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.240
Everything about you is everything to me.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.320
I don't want to hold back anymore!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:50.330
I remember. We got G.D.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.040
Let's follow the course where our curiosity leads...

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.960
...and I know a wondrous power will be born.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:01.050
Silent City. We're Salvagers.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:03.880
Let's go out sometime and try to find...

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.890
...the skyscrapers in the sunken cities below.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:11.470
Don't be afraid. Come together.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:16.810
As the sun shines down upon us...

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:22.240
...now, let's try to recover...

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:27.320
...everything that's been lost!

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:33.450
Let's journey beyond time!

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:40.920
I miss you! I want to take it to you!

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:44.220
I don't want you to forget about me.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:49.180
I take you! Because there is...

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:55.180
...a shining world that no one's ever seen!

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:58.150
Let it go!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:03.320
Forever...

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:29.850
Looks like the military's in on this, too.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.050
The risk's too big.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:36.480
Gusto, I think we should just stay out of this.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.290
No, l'm in.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:37.780
Gusto!

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:41.740
I'll risk my life for love.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.020
So, you've made up your mind, Gusto?

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.700
Uh, well, actually...

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.880
Lagu confirmed.
Now retrieving.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.240
Magnificent.

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:20.900
Of course, a woman like
you looks good in anything.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.280
Miss Aika...

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:30.020
Forgive me.
I went through your documents.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:36.500
It seems your clients are
people I know quite well.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:42.220
Well, I didn't think they
really trusted me, anyway.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.130
No matter.
I'm in a good mood today.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.920
Mainly because I was finally able...

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.860
...to obtain today what I have so longed for.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:55.450
Moreover because it is the
greatest possession of all.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.300
Observe.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.360
Do you know what this is?

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:04.150
Yes, it's your objective.
The Lagu you're searching for.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.450
Lagu? That's it?

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.370
The catastrophe 20 years
ago was a terrible one.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:14.500
The energy which destroyed countless cities...

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:20.890
...split the earth open and
awakened long-dormant volcanoes.

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:25.430
Miss Aika, I believe your country
suffered greatly in this.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.720
What are you getting at?

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:31.640
What if I said that Lagu and that
catastrophe are not unrelated?

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:33.100
You mean...?!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.180
Let me show you something interesting.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:47.490
That's a beam gun powered by refined Lagu energy.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.760
Amazing power, isn't it?

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:58.920
But this is just a toy to keep the military occupied.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.710
Merely a part of the true power of Lagu.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:07.680
Yes... The power of Lagu is far more than this.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.930
Miss Aika, do you understand why Lagu exists?

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:19.780
Lagu exists for a special reason, doesn't it?

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.610
Exactly.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:26.030
What you just saw now was just one of Lagu's uses.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:31.020
Besides the potential for mass
destruction it holds, it also...

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.830
...has a special wave motion...

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.780
...which can change matter
at the subatomic level.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:38.420
It could clean our polluted atmosphere and land.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.260
Even restore the ocean.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:46.270
It has the power to make the
Earth the way it should be.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:50.280
In short, the energy for
massive destruction Lagu has...

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:54.880
...is a power necessary for restoration.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:07:01.600
Yes, of course. For the
restoration of the Earth.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.920
The infection on the Earth,
known as "humanity"...

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:09.420
...is responsible for the sudden
destruction and changes on it.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:14.130
To survive, the Earth devised a
vaccine to fight the infection.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.200
That is the true meaning
of Lagu's existence.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.210
To eradicate the infection.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:23.730
In short, to destroy human civilization.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:28.770
The catastrophe 20 years ago was only the beginning.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.620
Interesting story.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:36.060
But why tell me such vital information?

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:40.960
No reason. In any case, I don't
need to stay with these fools now.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:44.520
I now need only to realize my next project.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.260
Next project...?

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:53.030
How about it, Miss Aika?
Won't you join me?

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:56.100
It would be such a pity
to part company now.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.740
All I want is data on Lagu.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.120
Nothing else interests me.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:06.420
You can have anything.
Anything at all...

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:14.650
Perhaps you should
give it some thought.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.420
I'll await a favorable response.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:20.640
So?

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.640
Find anything?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:26.770
Nope, nothing suspicious.
They're just clothes.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.110
I can't believe she just
came here with those!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.610
Really.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.320
How about her?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.160
For now, l'll give her a vitamin shot.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.740
She'll be awake soon, right?

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:41.680
Okay, that's that.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:46.290
Uh, oh! Shift change! lf we don't
hurry, we'll be punished again!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.780
Wait up!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.680
C'mon, give me my clothes back!

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.460
What'll I do?

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:20.790
What's wrong, Nena?
ls it that woman?

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:23.650
It's nothing to laugh about!

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.210
Nena...

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.620
Big Brother...

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:30.670
Don't try to fool me!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.680
No fair...

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:57.320
What's with this place?
There's nothing but chicks here!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.770
Ow...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.690
And... Here we go!

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:17.220
Daring.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:23.130
A little showy, but I don't
really have much choice.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:27.190
But this is a little too... Uh-oh!

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:30.310
Ohh, we're finally off duty!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:33.370
I just want to grab a hot shower and a cold beer.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.200
Sound good to me.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:38.740
By the way, the ship's been
stopped for a while, hasn't it?

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.840
Yeah. Looks like we're docked at some island.

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.200
One of the Blue squad told me.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.480
I wonder if we can go ashore.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.150
Even if they were doing that,
we'd never get a turn.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:51.370
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:53.670
I've heard they found the Lagu.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:54.920
Huh? Seriously?

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:59.300
Maybe we'll get a vacation once they recover it.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:03.520
I hope so! We've been stuck
on this ship for ages!

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.570
I'd like to go shopping.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.610
Hey, guess what--

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.900
Good God. You...

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:16.340
...have really bad taste in underwear.

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:18.930
Nothing personal, but get some new ones.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.150
R- Right...

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.440
Hey, did you hear?

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:22.340
About what?

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.150
You'll never believe it!

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:25.660
So? Tell us!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:30.320
Miss Nena got beaten up by
some woman in a weird get-up!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:30.860
No way!

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.830
Oh, I heard that, too!

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:39.340
I heard from one of the Blue team!
A weird girl threw her 3 meters!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.300
Really? Wow!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.860
The one whose jet was
shot down this afternoon?

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:45.760
I hear she's a Salvager!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.720
So, is Miss Nena hurt really badly?

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.810
No, looks like she's okay.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.190
Well, she's not exactly normal.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.160
Hey, watch it!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:58.210
If a Blue or White officer
heard that, you'd get in trouble!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:11:58.970
No kidding.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:02.260
Then l'd ask Mr. Hargen to save me!

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.860
KYaa~ You wish!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:10.250
Except I heard Mr. Hargen
really likes that weird woman.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.140
Huh? Seriously?

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.570
What about Miss Nena?

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:16.340
Yeah, right!
Her pride must be shattered.

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:19.670
So, what's that weird girl doing now?

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.640
Who are you?

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.910
Um, er, that is...

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:28.040
Well, if Mr. Hargen likes her...

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.280
Then, right now...

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:30.910
Huh? What? What?

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.640
What do you think?

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.610
Oh, God!
I can't believe we said that!

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:39.570
Uh-oh...

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:55.140
Yes, sir. Nothing unusual at the moment.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:57.210
What? But...

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.540
Right now? Aye, aye, sir.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:04.150
Engines to full! Engage side thruster control engines!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.420
Prepare to move out!

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:06.590
Preparing to move out!

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:07.360
Weigh anchor!

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:08.560
Weighing anchor!

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.660
I can trust you, can't l?

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.740
I thought you'd come.

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:42.130
I'm enough of a gentleman
that I won't hit your face.

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:49.290
Christ, and all I did was ask for directions.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:53.000
Well, I doubt they
would have told me, anyway.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:58.520
Hang on, Aika!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.580
Oh, which way should I go?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.930
All right!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.850
Could that be the Lagu?

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.120
Yeah, it's gotta be.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:38.900
But besides that...

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.480
Who's that suspicious-looking girl?

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.550
Could she be...

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:47.950
You two there!
What are you doing?!

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.730
Uh-oh!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:54.090
Who's she? Don't tell
me someone followed me!

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:58.520
Unauthorized personnel
aren't allowed in here!

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:01.170
Especially Black staff.
That includes you!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.130
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:04.460
So, who told you to come in here?

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:08.800
Well, um, it was, you know, sort of, er...

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.760
Speak up! Answer me!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.110
Right! That girl can explain!
Ask her.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:16.120
What are you doing?!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:19.050
Um, I mean, you should ask her.

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:22.270
There's something fishy about you two.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.730
Show me your l.D. card.

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:26.490
Come on!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.700
Now it's REALLY "uh-oh"...

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.660
What?!
That's the emergency alert.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.670
Hey, you two! Hold it!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.250
I gotta get back to my post!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.630
Me, too!

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:51.040
You've got nowhere to run!
Drop the your gun and surrender!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.390
Christ... Like hell I will!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:00.060
Well, things look pretty hopeless now.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:03.350
But a hero doesn't give up in these situations!

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:08.900
Hey, you! You shoot so bad you
couldn't hit me in a million years!

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:25.760
Ladies, those long things are
useless in a tight space like this.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:26.290
Later!

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:35.120
To us on this night...
Oh, pardon me.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:37.560
You can't hold a glass like that.

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:47.480
I was very intrigued in my study of this.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:52.710
Ultranate Metal. It's the first
time l've actually seen it.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:54.570
I didn't know this device existed.

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:05.120
As I scientist, I find this fascinating.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:09.400
But I find your attraction even more powerful.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.590
Wait.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:14.550
I'll do it myself.

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.810
Excuse me, Miss Nena...

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:28.090
That slimy little bitch!

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:30.750
Just stringing my brother along!

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:34.780
Whaddaya want?!

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.520
Y- Yes, ma'am! Uh...

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.180
Beautiful.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:57.720
And the data?

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.810
What do you think?

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:06.770
I'll trust you.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.160
Oh, hell...

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:30.650
This is pathetic.
Some hero I turn out to be!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:35.100
Still, l've gotta figure out something to do...

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.210
Oh, dear.

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:41.140
You got me, you got me.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.770
Gimme the gun! Nice and slow!

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.810
Yes, ma'am. Here, take it.

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.600
Magnificent.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:02.370
I become humble in the face of beautiful things.

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:04.830
How flattering.

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:08.710
Won't you join me?
l'll make it worth your while.

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:11.280
But I don't really want anything.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.840
There's no shame in changing your mind.

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.250
Excuse ME!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:26.890
Gusto!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:33.190
Aika?! And after I risked
my life to save you...!

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:35.820
You idiot! lt's not like that!

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:37.710
I see...

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:40.740
He's forcing you, isn't he!
Why, you pervert!

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:45.890
Let's go!

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:47.160
Huh? Where?

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:50.130
You idiot! To escape!

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.370
Wait!

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:56.500
Don't you want the data you
were going to sell your body for?

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.260
Don't worry. I already have it.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.740
See you!

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:06.850
See you? Hey, Aika! Wait up!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:14.440
Now, look... How long are you
gonna follow me? Go away!

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:18.650
Don't be silly. You're the one
wandering around in front of me.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.760
You! You're really annoying
for someone so suspicious.

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:25.020
As much as you are.

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:29.540
The woman under interrogation
has escaped with the intruder!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:31.290
Capture on sight! Repeat...

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.060
It must be Aika!
What should I do?

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:36.370
But who's the intruder she's with?

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.860
Now I see.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:40.420
You were with the woman
from the jet, weren't you?

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:43.440
Wh- Why, that's totally absurd.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:44.620
I'm right.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:48.740
Uh, anyway,
l'm kinda in a hurry, so... Bye!

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:52.120
The two escapees are confirmed to be on deck one!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.770
Blue team, move to deck one at once!

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:55.660
Repeat...

00:20:56.170 --> 00:21:00.030
You have nowhere to run!
Drop the gun and surrender now!

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:03.890
Aika! l'll distract them
and you jump into the water!

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:07.560
No! I appreciate the thought,
but Rion's still in there.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:09.730
This is no time for...

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.500
The man-stealer has a boyfriend?!
That's a laugh!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.130
Miss Nena—

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:15.460
Move aside!

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:23.630
I like you less and
less all the time.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:25.590
Well, fine...

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:32.890
I'll kill you. I'll fillet that
disGustoing face right off of you.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.350
Very carefully...

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:38.170
Miss Nena...

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:42.850
Mr. Hargen, shouldn't we stop Miss Nena?

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.840
I don't care.
Let her do as she wishes.

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:47.770
Then bring it to me.

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:48.240
Yes, sir.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:52.200
Shit! I won't let you lay a finger on Aika!

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:53.440
Stay out of this!

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.250
Gusto!

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:03.720
Aika!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:08.220
I didn't think you'd jump in front of him!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:12.270
Then l'll slice you up,
just as you want me to!

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:14.230
Stop it, god damn you!

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:19.410
Next time you move, l'll blow your head off.

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:24.740
Cry more!

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:27.860
Wha...?!

00:22:34.610 --> 00:22:35.350
Hey!

00:22:35.350 --> 00:22:37.750
No! Don't touch me!

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:45.100
No! Stop it!

00:22:49.650 --> 00:22:51.900
What are you waiting for?!
Shoot! Shoot!

00:23:05.450 --> 00:23:06.360
Impossible...

00:23:12.350 --> 00:23:13.160
You monster!

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:37.390
H... Holy...

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:45.650
Are... Are you really Aika?

00:23:46.790 --> 00:23:50.770
Me? I am Aika, and yet not Aika.

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:54.120
I assist and protect the Aika you know.

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:57.950
Ah, so this is the power of Ultranate.

00:23:57.950 --> 00:24:00.580
Fascinating. Did you bring it?

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:01.610
Right here.

00:24:18.450 --> 00:24:23.400
Forgive me, but I can't let you
hurt anymore of my people.

00:24:31.560 --> 00:24:35.490
What's happening?! My body
feels like it's coming apart!

00:24:35.520 --> 00:24:37.370
Why?! What's happening?!

00:24:41.440 --> 00:24:46.130
No use!
Can't stay conscious...!

00:25:02.890 --> 00:25:03.680
Aika!

00:25:04.800 --> 00:25:08.070
As I thought, it had some effect.
Excellent.

00:25:08.070 --> 00:25:11.530
Take the woman captive.
Kill the man if you wish.

00:25:12.100 --> 00:25:14.140
Speak to me, Aika! Hey!

00:25:15.540 --> 00:25:17.830
Hand the woman over!

00:25:21.830 --> 00:25:24.060
Shit! Aika...

00:25:28.630 --> 00:25:29.920
Aika...

00:25:30.760 --> 00:25:31.590
Aika!

00:25:32.510 --> 00:25:34.740
Aika!!!

00:25:53.030 --> 00:25:57.120
Let's go out into the bustling city.

00:25:59.700 --> 00:26:07.460
I just want to slip off my boots and walk along with the wind.

00:26:08.670 --> 00:26:12.840
That feeling of honesty that I had forgotten...

00:26:15.220 --> 00:26:23.380
...is reawakened with just a single deep breath.

00:26:24.310 --> 00:26:28.270
As I sit by the window in the moonlight...

00:26:28.270 --> 00:26:33.150
...with my chin cupped in my hand...

00:26:33.150 --> 00:26:38.700
...I find myself thinking of you.

00:26:38.700 --> 00:26:47.330
Though I have kept it in my
heart for such a... such a long time...

00:26:47.330 --> 00:26:54.460
...without thinking, I look back at the person I used to be.

00:26:54.460 --> 00:27:02.390
I know, oh, I know.
It's because I'm much more naive than I look.

00:27:02.890 --> 00:27:12.860
Always wavering,
caught somewhere between cowardice and arrogance.

00:27:25.700 --> 00:27:34.210
Since those feelings are
growing stronger and stronger inside...

00:27:34.210 --> 00:27:41.390
...I gradually feel that there's a new tomorrow for me.

00:27:41.390 --> 00:27:45.810
Though I may hesitate, though I may dream...

00:27:45.810 --> 00:27:49.940
Though I may keep taking the long way around...

00:27:49.940 --> 00:27:53.860
...when I eventually reach that place...

00:27:53.860 --> 00:27:59.990
...I want to be met by your smiling face.

00:28:33.340 --> 00:28:36.080
Aika, has fallen to Hargen's marksmanship.

00:28:36.510 --> 00:28:39.030
Aika, what's going to happen to me?

00:28:39.810 --> 00:28:44.820
Now alone, Rion teams up with
the mysterious beauty, Maypia.

00:28:45.130 --> 00:28:46.630
As they wander the ship...

00:28:46.630 --> 00:28:49.290
...they're caught up in
Hargen's war with the military.

00:28:49.290 --> 00:28:51.750
Listen, you jerk!
Let go of me!

00:28:51.750 --> 00:28:55.850
Like hell I will! You're just
gonna escape by yourself, right?!

00:28:55.850 --> 00:28:58.690
Hargen's destructive project begins to unfold...

00:28:59.210 --> 00:29:04.410
...and to save Rion, Aika and
Gusto reboard Hargen's ship.

00:29:05.240 --> 00:29:07.750
Aika! You came back for me!

00:29:08.170 --> 00:29:12.260
Aika, next trial: Take off Position.

00:29:12.740 --> 00:29:16.020
Into the blue skies, a demon takes flight.
